config BQ_RA_READER
	tristate "BQ28Z610 RA table reader"
	depends on I2C && I2C_SMBUS && SYSFS
	help
	  Read the NFG1000B/BQ28Z610 RA table through a read-only sysfs node.

config RA_READER
	tristate "Reusable I2C MAC read framework"
	depends on I2C && I2C_SMBUS && SYSFS
	help
	  A generic, chip-agnostic I2C AltManufacturerAccess (MAC) read framework.
	  Write a command number to sysfs and the module reads the raw 36-byte
	  response 5 seconds later into a read-only sysfs node. No chip-specific
	  field parsing is performed.
